## Git Concepts

### Good Commit Messages

Examples:

```bash
git commit -m "Added contact section"

git commit -m "Added learning section"

git commit -m "Updated profile page"
```

Good commit messages clearly describe what changed.

## New HTML Tags

### h2 Tag

```html
<h2></h2>
```

Used to create section headings.

### ul Tag

```html
<ul>
</ul>
```

Creates an unordered list.

### li Tag

```html
<li></li>
```

Creates a list item.

Example:

```html
<ul>
    <li>HTML</li>
    <li>CSS</li>
    <li>Git & GitHub</li>
    <li>JavaScript</li>
</ul>
```

Output:

* HTML
* CSS
* Git & GitHub
* JavaScript

